{"sections":[{"slug":"拟凝聚层","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"拟凝聚层"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"拟凝聚层"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的拟凝聚层是环上的模的推广</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是代数几何中的一种代数对象</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"). <span lang=\"zh\">取拟凝聚层</span> $X \\mapsto \\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成一个由</span> (qcqs) <span lang=\"zh\">概形到</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的嵌入</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层有高阶范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">推广</span>"}},{"Plain":": "},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">传统</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的拟凝聚层是</span> $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足在每个仿射</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/开嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">开子概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Spec} A\\hookrightarrow X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上等同于某个</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的模层</span> $\\widetilde M$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">函子式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的拟凝聚层范畴是</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{QCoh}(X) := \\operatorname{lim}_{\\operatorname{Spec}A \\to X}\\mathsf{Mod}(A).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Spec}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的拟凝聚层就定义为</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">而一般概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的拟凝聚层范畴</span> $\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是由如下</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出</span>:\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{ccc}\r\n\\mathsf{Aff} &amp; \\overset{\\mathsf{Mod}}{\\to} &amp; \\mathsf{Cat} \\\\\r\n\\downarrow &amp; \\nearrow &amp;\\\\\r\n\\mathsf{Sch}&amp;&amp;\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathsf{Aff} \\to \\mathsf{Sch}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">截面的可控奇异性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为拟紧拟分离概形</span>, $f\\in\\Gamma(X,\\mathcal O_X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为整体函数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">不消失的开子空间</span> $X_f$, <span lang=\"zh\">则对任意拟凝聚层</span> $F$,\n$$\r\nF(X)_f \\to F(X_f)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个事实的一种直观是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层截面的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">奇异性</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">总是可控的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">类似于一个亚纯函数</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}